task.action:
- Add optional iconColor parameter of type vscode.ThemeColor to DocsActionItem constructor
- Update ThemeIcon instantiation to use color when provided

Current code (docs-view.capability.ts:12-27):
```typescript
export class DocsActionItem extends vscode.TreeItem {
  constructor(
    label: string,
    iconName: string,
    public readonly actionCommand: string
  ) {
    super(label, vscode.TreeItemCollapsibleState.None);
    this.iconPath = new vscode.ThemeIcon(iconName);
    // ...
  }
}
```

Change to:
```typescript
export class DocsActionItem extends vscode.TreeItem {
  constructor(
    label: string,
    iconName: string,
    public readonly actionCommand: string,
    iconColor?: vscode.ThemeColor
  ) {
    super(label, vscode.TreeItemCollapsibleState.None);
    this.iconPath = new vscode.ThemeIcon(iconName, iconColor);
    // ...
  }
}
```

- Change productActionItem instantiation to use 'play' icon with green ThemeColor

Current code (docs-view.capability.ts:204-208):
```typescript
const productActionItem = new DocsActionItem(
  'Map Product Docs',
  'book',
  '/kanban-map-product'
);
```

Change to:
```typescript
const productActionItem = new DocsActionItem(
  'Map Product Docs',
  'play',
  '/kanban-map-product',
  new vscode.ThemeColor('charts.green')
);
```

